WEBVTT

00:53:57.987 --> 00:54:00.048
EG: I see the world
through a Rayya filter,

00:54:00.072 --> 00:54:02.990
and I don't want to not see the world
through a Rayya filter.

00:54:03.014 --> 00:54:05.367
It's a better world, seen
through a Rayya filter.

00:54:05.938 --> 00:54:09.282
CA: So how do you think
of your own future now, Liz?

00:54:09.306 --> 00:54:16.122
Like, do you see days of joy
and delight and hope ahead?

00:54:16.146 --> 00:54:18.679
Or are you now signed up

00:54:18.703 --> 00:54:22.844
as another of the world's great,
great cynics about life,

00:54:22.868 --> 00:54:24.029
if you like,

00:54:24.053 --> 00:54:26.541
that it's all dust to dust,
ashes to ashes,

00:54:26.565 --> 00:54:27.797
there's nothing there?

00:54:27.821 --> 00:54:30.133
EG: It is dust to dust, ashes to ashes,